return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-14T12:27:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-14T12:27:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A fast, privacy-respecting live chat for your website. Answers visitors with AI when you are busy, hands them to you when they need a person, and emails you anything you miss. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until somebody opens it.'=>'一个适用于您网站的快速、尊重隐私的实时聊天工具。在您忙碌时用AI回答访客提问，在他们需要人工时转交给您，并把您错过的所有内容发邮件通知您。网页加载体积小于 10 KB，在有人打开之前不会产生任何请求。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Settings'=>'设置','That does not look like a Zinn® Chat key. Copy it from the Live chat page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard — it starts with zc_.'=>'这看起来不像是一个 Zinn® Chat 密钥。请从您的 Zinn Digital® 控制面板的“在线聊天”页面复制——它以 zc_ 开头。','Add your chat key before switching the chat on — without it there is nothing for the widget to connect to.'=>'在开启聊天之前请先添加您的聊天密钥——否则小部件将无法连接任何内容。','Live chat for this site. Visitors get an answer straight away, you get anything you miss by email, and the whole thing is under 10 KB on the page.'=>'本网站的在线客服。访客可立即获得回复，您错过的消息将通过电子邮件发送给您，且整个脚本在网页上的大小不到 10 KB。','The chat is live on this site.'=>'本网站已开通在线聊天。','The chat is switched off. Nothing is loaded on your site.'=>'聊天功能已关闭。您的网站未加载任何内容。','Chat key'=>'聊天密钥','Copy this from the Live chat page of your %s.'=>'从您的 %s 的在线聊天页面中复制此内容。','Zinn Digital® dashboard'=>'Zinn Digital® 仪表板','Show the chat'=>'显示聊天','Show the chat window to visitors of this site'=>'向该网站的访客显示聊天窗口','Until you tick this, the plugin adds nothing at all to your pages — no script, no cookie, no requests.'=>'在您勾选此项之前，插件不会向您的页面添加任何内容——没有脚本，没有Cookie，也没有请求。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的用户而构建的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖已建成的网站、域名和链接外链，交易资金将安全托管，直到双方满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作家、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'请参阅 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未通过完整性检查，因此未安装。','Everything here keeps working for nothing, for ever. Pro is for when one person answering, and a month of history, stops being enough.'=>'这里的一切将永远免费保持运行。Pro版适用于单人回复以及一个月的历史记录不再满足需求的情况。','As many colleagues answering at once as you like — the free plugin allows one.'=>'您可以让任意数量的同事同时回复——免费插件仅允许一人。','Every conversation kept for ever, instead of thirty days.'=>'所有对话永久保存，而非常规的三十天。','Your own name on the chat window, with ours removed.'=>'聊天窗口显示您自己的名称，并移除我们的名称。','Saved replies, transfer a conversation to a colleague, and business hours.'=>'已保存的回复、将对话转接给同事以及营业时间。','5,000 AI answers a month rather than 100.'=>'每月 5,000 个 AI 回答，而不是 100 个。','Choose exactly which pages the chat appears on — or hide it from the checkout.'=>'精确选择显示聊天的页面——或者将其在结账页面中隐藏。','One licence covers three of your sites; ten-site licences are available.'=>'一个许可证可覆盖您的三个站点；另提供十个站点的许可证。','See what Pro costs'=>'查看 Pro 的价格','Already host a site with Zinn Digital®? Pro is included free — your key is on the %s.'=>'已经在 Zinn Digital® 托管了网站？专业版免费包含在内 —— 您的密钥在 %s 上。','Licences page of your dashboard'=>'您仪表板上的“许可证”页面','Your licence is active.'=>'您的许可证处于活动状态。','Your licence has run out but everything still works for a short while. Renew it to keep receiving updates.'=>'您的许可证已过期，但所有功能在短时间内仍可正常使用。请续费以继续接收更新。','We do not recognise that licence key. Copy it again from the Licences page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'我们不识别该许可证密钥。请从您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表板的“许可证”页面重新复制它。','That key is for a different Zinn® plugin. The one you want is on the Licences page of your dashboard, next to Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'该密钥适用于另一个 Zinn® 插件。您需要的密钥位于仪表板的“许可证”页面上，紧邻 Zinn® Chat Pro。','Your licence has expired. Renew it from your Zinn Digital® dashboard to switch the Pro features back on.'=>'您的许可证已过期。请从您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表板续费以重新启用 Pro 功能。','This licence has been cancelled.'=>'此许可证已被取消。','This licence is on hold. Please get in touch and we will sort it out.'=>'此许可证已被暂停。请与我们联系，我们将为您解决。','There is a billing problem on your Zinn Digital® account. Once it is settled the licence works again straight away.'=>'您的 Zinn Digital® 账户存在账单问题。问题解决后，许可证将立即恢复正常。','This licence came free with your Zinn® hosting, and that hosting has ended. Buy a licence, or start hosting with us again, to switch Pro back on.'=>'您的 Zinn® 主机服务附赠了此许可证，而该主机服务现已到期。请购买许可证，或重新开始使用我们的主机服务，以重新启用 Pro。','Every site on this licence is in use. Release one below, or upgrade to cover more sites.'=>'此许可证下的每个站点都已在使用中。请释放下方的一个站点，或升级以涵盖更多站点。','We could not confirm your licence just now. Nothing has changed on your site; we will try again shortly.'=>'我们目前无法确认您的许可证。您的网站没有发生任何变化；我们将很快重试。','You do not have permission to manage licences on this site.'=>'您没有权限管理此网站上的许可证。','Your Pro licence'=>'您的 Pro 许可证','Licence key'=>'许可证密钥','Copy it from the Licences page of your %s.'=>'从您的 %s 的“许可证”页面复制。','Renews on %s.'=>'将在 %s 续费。','Using %1$d of %2$d sites.'=>'已使用 %1$d / %2$d 个站点。','In use on: %s. Release one from your dashboard, then try again.'=>'当前正用于：%s。请在控制台中释放一个，然后重试。','Save licence'=>'保存许可证','Remove it from this site'=>'从本网站中移除','Where the chat appears'=>'聊天显示位置','Show it'=>'显示','Everywhere on this site'=>'全站','Only on the pages I choose below'=>'仅在我下方选择的页面上','Everywhere except the pages I choose below'=>'以下我选择的页面除外','Page or post IDs'=>'页面或文章 ID','Separate them with commas. The ID is in the address bar while you edit a page.'=>'用逗号分隔它们。在编辑页面时，ID 位于地址栏中。','Whole content types'=>'所有内容类型','Signed-in visitors'=>'已登录访客','Hide the chat from people who are signed in to this site'=>'向已登录此网站的用户隐藏聊天','Save where it appears'=>'保存显示位置']];